 "summary": "An agent programming language based on the situation calculus: high-level programs built from primitive actions, tests, sequence, nondeterministic choice of actions and arguments, iteration and procedures are macro-expanded into situation-calculus formulas (Do) and executed by theorem proving over a basic action theory; extended by ConGolog (concurrency, interrupts) and IndiGolog (online sensing).",
 "status": "historical",
